{"ref":"BDB, צָלַל","hw":"צָלַל","html":"† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צָלַל</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. tingle, quiver (</strong>NH <span dir=\"rtl\">צִלְצֵל</span> <em>whirr;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">صَلَّ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">صَلْصَلَ</span>; 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">צְלַל</span>; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܨܰܠ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָֽלְלוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.16\">Hb 3:16</a>; Impf. 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּצִלֶּינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 3:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.3.11\">1 S 3:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּצַּלְנָה</span> (Ges<sup>§ 67g</sup>) <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.12\">2 K 21:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.3\">Je 19:3</a>;—<em>tingle</em>, of ears, at horrid sound <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 3:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.3.11\">1 S 3:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.12\">2 K 21:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 19:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.19.3\">Je 19:3</a> (all of dreadful news); of lips, <em>quiver</em> in terror <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:16\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.16\">Hb 3:16</a>.","next":"BDB, צִלְצָל","prev":"BDB, צָלִי²"}